				"The video opens with a WIDE SHOT of a sun-drenched underwater realm, where beams of light pierce the surface, illuminating ancient, moss-covered rock formations. The camera slowly TRACKS FORWARD to reveal a serene 21-year-old Chinese woman with flowing brown hair adorned with a white flower. She wears an ethereal white and gold gown that drifts gracefully in the currents. Beside her, a magnificent white and gold Chinese dragon, its scales shimmering and whiskers flowing, gently circles. The camera then executes a SLOW ORBIT SHOT around the pair as the woman reaches out a delicate hand, her fingers almost touching the dragon's snout. A CLOSE-UP focuses on the gentle interaction between the woman's hand and the dragon's intricate scales. The dragon softly nudges its head towards her, its wise eyes conveying a sense of ancient understanding. The camera then TILTS UP to follow the dragon's majestic form as it gracefully curves through the water, its long body weaving around the woman. Schools of vibrant orange goldfish swim curiously around them, adding to the magical atmosphere. The background subtly shifts, revealing a hidden grotto filled with glowing coral and other mystical underwater flora. The camera then DOLLIES OUT to a MEDIUM SHOT, showcasing the harmonious connection between the woman and the dragon in this breathtaking, mythical underwater scene, bathed in the radiant sunlight filtering from above."
